Z||000000||Kelvin Vivian||09-06-2001||05:06 PM||||1. Does anyone know how to swap out T-top locks? I cannot remove the long plastic trim on the edge of the glass that surrounds the locks. It appears that the lever contraption completely traps the plastic trim and I have no idea how they got it on.<P>2. P-Seals, are they still available and from whom?<P>Thanks in advance,<BR>KV||||reg||5
